---
import Layout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { changeLanguage } from "~/i18n";
import { localizePath } from "~/i18n";

changeLanguage("en");

const meta = {
  title: "About Us | The Kitchen Studio - Kitchen Furniture in Glyfada, Athens",
  description: "The Kitchen Studio in Glyfada designs and installs custom kitchen furniture, bathroom cabinets, tiles, wardrobes, and living room furniture. Over 20 years of expertise. Custom solutions for every need and budget.",
};

const aboutSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "AboutPage",
  name: "About Us - The Kitchen Studio",
  url: "https://www.thekitchenstudio.gr/en/about-us",
  description: meta.description,
  // Reference the canonical business entity rendered by MetaTags on every page
  mainEntity: { "@id": "https://www.thekitchenstudio.gr/#business" },
};
---

<Layout meta={meta} lang="EN">
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(aboutSchema)} />

  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-20">

    <!-- Intro -->
    <header class="mb-14">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent mb-3">About Us</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold font-heading leading-tight mb-6">
        The design that defines The Kitchen Studio
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        The need for specialisation in the design and production of kitchen and bedroom wardrobe furniture
        led to the creation of <strong>The Kitchen Studio</strong>. With a showroom in Glyfada and over
        20 years of experience, we design spaces that combine international ergonomic standards, high-quality
        materials, and personal style.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Core sections -->
    <div class="space-y-14">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Experience &amp; Expertise</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          A kitchen renovation is not merely an aesthetic choice. It requires deep knowledge of ergonomics,
          functionality, and manufacturing technology. We know that a well-designed kitchen must meet
          international production standards and be built around the way you actually use the space.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Beyond design knowledge, our team has hands-on experience across all renovation stages:
          material selection (solid wood, MDF, Corian®, lacquered surfaces), hardware and accessories
          (Blum/Hettich drawer systems, integrated lighting, worktops), and coordination with
          contractors, architects, and electricians.
        </p>
        <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-6">
          {[
            "Design to international ergonomic standards",
            "3D rendering before any order is placed",
            "Premium materials from leading manufacturers",
            "Installation by a specialist in-house team",
            "Warranty and after-sales technical support",
            "Service for architects & interior designers",
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-sm">{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Collaborations &amp; Range</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          The Kitchen Studio designs and manufactures its own furniture, and also works with leading
          leading European furniture manufacturers, offering a wide range of proposals to suit any
          need and budget, from cost-effective renovation solutions to fully bespoke premium builds.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          For bathroom solutions we work closely with
          <a href="https://ikaradimas.gr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Ioannis Karadimas</a>,
          providing complete bathroom design proposals of the highest aesthetic quality.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Our projects have been featured in the prestigious <strong>Villas by ek magazine</strong>,
          recognising our commitment to excellence in design and craftsmanship.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">What We Do</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          At our Glyfada showroom you will find complete solutions for every room in your home:
        </p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          {[
            { title: "Kitchen Furniture", desc: "Modern, classic, and Corian kitchens, built to your exact specifications.", href: "/kitchens" },
            { title: "Bathroom Furniture", desc: "Contemporary vanity units and Corian surfaces for an elegant bathroom.", href: "/bath" },
            { title: "Tiles", desc: "Wide range of sizes, formats, and finishes.", href: "/tiles" },
            { title: "Wardrobes", desc: "Custom bedroom wardrobes with fully configured interiors.", href: "/wardrobes" },
            { title: "Doors", desc: "Interior doors in wood, glass, and metal.", href: "/doors" },
            { title: "Living Room", desc: "Living room furniture that transforms your lounge.", href: "/living" },
          ].map(({ title, desc, href }) => (
            <a
              href={localizePath(href)}
              class="block p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-neutral-800 rounded-xl hover:border-accent dark:hover:border-accent transition-colors group">
              <p class="font-semibold group-hover:text-accent transition-colors mb-1">{title}</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">{desc}</p>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Visit Our Showroom</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          The designers of The Kitchen Studio invite you to our purpose-built
          <a href={localizePath("/showroom")} class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Showroom</a> at
          <strong>28 Grigoriou Lampraki, Glyfada</strong>, whether you are a private homeowner or a
          professional architect, interior designer, or engineer. We will analyse your needs together
          and offer tailored solutions.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          There is no commitment involved: come and meet us, browse material samples, and get an initial
          feel for your project. We serve clients across Glyfada, Voula, Vouliagmeni, Elliniko,
          Argyroupoli, Alimos, and throughout Attica.
        </p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 rounded-xl mb-6">
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Address</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">28 Grigoriou Lampraki, Glyfada 166 74, Greece</p>
            <p class="font-semibold mt-3 mb-1">Phone</p>
            <a href="tel:+302108981423" class="text-accent hover:underline text-sm">+30 210 8981423</a>
            <p class="font-semibold mt-3 mb-1">Email</p>
            <a href="mailto:info@thekitchenstudio.gr" class="text-accent hover:underline text-sm">info@thekitchenstudio.gr</a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Opening Hours</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">Mon / Wed / Sat: 10:00 – 14:00</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Tue / Thu / Fri: 10:00 – 14:00 &amp; 17:30 – 20:30</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href={localizePath("/contact")}
            class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-accent hover:bg-accent-hover text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors">
            Book an Appointment
          </a>
          <a
            href={localizePath("/showroom")}
            class="inline-block px-6 py-3 border border-gray-300 dark:border-neutral-700 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-neutral-800 font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors">
            View Showroom
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
